<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pioneer-Standard raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pioneer-Standard raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co said Wednesday it raised Pioneer-Standard Electronics Inc to buy from hold and raised its earnings estimate for next year.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Chuck Thomas said in a report he maintained his estimate for the March-ending current year at $1.00 a share versus $1.14 last year and raised next year's estimate to $1.30 from $1.25 a share. He also introduced a fiscal 1999 estimate of $1.65.</p>
<p>-- He cautioned revenue and earnings growth could slow for the electronics components distributor if the industry slows.</p>
<p>-- Its stock was off 1/8 to 15-1/4 on Nasdaq.</p>
<p>((Cleveland Newsdesk, Susan Zimmerman 216-579-0077))</p>
